('1', 'proj_2e6458480a81', '2026-08-31 10:16:21', 'success', '{\"rows_synced\":25000,\"timeline_days\":366,\"property_used\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpoets.com\\/\",\"date_range\":\"2025-08-29 to 2026-08-29\"}', '0', '0', ''),
('2', 'proj_2e6458480a81', '2026-10-01 09:59:00', 'success', '{\"rows_synced\":20128,\"timeline_days\":365,\"property_used\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpoets.com\\/\",\"date_range\":\"2025-10-01 to 2026-10-01\"}', '15', '1722', '[\"hello, thank you for your comment. here is the website mentioned in the video: https:\\/\\/watch-v2.autoembed.cc this platform helps users discover and explore movies and tv series from different providers in one place. it\\u2019s useful for browsing titles, checking availability, and discovering content across multiple platforms. you can search for movies or series and explore different categories to find what you\\u2019re looking for more easily. this information is shared for educational and content-discovery purposes only. for more hidden websites, tech discoveries, and useful online resources, feel free to follow the page.\",\"a business owner opens explore and chooses free form from the templates at the top of the page. once there, she adds the dimensions and metrics she wants to see in her table. where should she drag and drop her dimensions and metrics to build the table above?\",\"wordpress site migration ( intitle:review or intitle:reviews or intitle:coupon or intitle:comparison or inurl:blog ) -store -cart -checkout -wholesale -site:amazon.com -site:tiktok.com -site:instagram.com -site:walmart.com -site:groupon.com -site:reddit.com -site:facebook.com -site:pinterest.com -site:youtube.com -intitle:affiliate\",\"you failed to correctly answer the math problem. this is used to combat spam when jetpack\\u2019s brute force attack protection api is unavailable. please use your browser\\u2019s back button to return to the login form, press the \\\"refresh\\\" button to generate a new math problem, and try to log in again.\",\"google search links: based on your blog content, blogger will automatically identify key words and phrases in your post and insert search links in case your readers want to explore more. in compose view, look for the \\u2018pencil\\u2019 icon on the top-right of the page to get started.\",\"you\'re a freelance writer who specializes in creating different types of content, including blog posts, social media captions, and website copy. you find yourself frequently switching between different writing styles and tones depending on the project. you want to streamline your workflow and ensure consistency in your writing across various formats. which feature of gemini best suits your needs?\",\"answer this question correctly to mark the module complete. a business owner opens explore and chooses free form from the templates at the top of the page. once there, she adds the dimensions and metrics she wants to see in her table. where should she drag and drop her dimensions and metrics to build the table above?\",\"thanks for contacting we want to do sponsored advertisement on your instagram page, we have some multinational brands and we\\u2019re affiliated with more than 10,000 brands. we\\u2019ll send you 10 created ads related to your page\\u2019s category, you can choose any two of them and place them on your page. i\\u2019ll explain each thing about how it works, first let us know how does it sounds to you? thanks!\",\"a local nonprofit has asked you to design a last-minute promo banner for an upcoming community event. the staff provided a photo that has a distracting background, and the deadline is hours away. which adobe express tool lets you remove that background with minimal time and effort?\",\"i am trying to do the ga4 form submission but it does not have ga4 tag type called \\\"google analytics: ga4 event\\\" in fact that is not longer an option on any tag types. the only options are google analytics, google ads, google tag , conversion linker... please advise\",\"to provide more context, on meta, i want to pause all ad sets during the weekend because its not profitable. the pause will be for 2 days. my daily budgets are inputted at the ad set level. for optimal performance, should i pause the entire campaign or pause all the ad sets while leaving the campaign on?\",\"an organization has implemented a new content filtering system to enhance its network security. the it department has noticed an increase in phishing attempts and wants to ensure that employees do not accidentally access malicious websites. they decide to configure the content filtering system to address this issue. which of the following configurations would be most effective in preventing access to websites known for phishing attacks? answer allowing all traffic and relying on antivirus software for protection implementing time-of-day restrictions for internet access enabling simple domain filtering to block known malicious urls blocking all social networking sites\",\"a marketing manager asks a data professional in human resources to share a spreadsheet. the spreadsheet contains four tabs. tabs 1-3 are meant for the marketing manager to edit, but tab 4 contains sensitive employee information. which of the following tactics will enable the data professional to keep tab 4 private? select all that apply.\",\"prompt: \\\"what are the benefits of jamstack architecture?\\\" answer above prompt considering user\\u2019s persona as \\\"information seekers: users who are researching a topic top of funnel and their prompt does not imply that they are looking to take an immediate action\\\". don\'t highlight user persona explicitly in response\",\"a business owner wants to understand how their website performance compares to competitors and asks if ga4 can provide insights into competitor traffic and user behavior. which of the following is the most accurate response regarding ga4\'s capabilities? group of answer choices ga4 only tracks data from the business\'s own website and does not provide insights into competitor analytics. competitive analysis requires external tools. ga4 includes an industry comparison feature that allows businesses to see estimated traffic data and engagement metrics from competitors\' websites. ga4 can track competitor data only if those competitors use ga4 and unknowingly share their analytics reports. while g\"]'),
